===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[let]] [[alone]]|lets alone|letting alone|let alone}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[leave alone]], [[let be]]; to stop bothering.
#: ''I wish he would '''let''' me '''alone''' so I could get some sleep.''

